    "description": "API collection for Fitness_App — a health application for BMI, TDEE, food logging, and activity recommendations.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints except `/api/auth/register`, `/api/auth/login`, `/api/auth/google`, and `/api/health` require authentication via httpOnly JWT cookie set by register/login.\n\nUse the **Register** or **Login** request first to set the cookie, then all subsequent requests will include it automatically (Postman's cookie jar handles this).",
